From: Bastiaan van der Plaat <bastiaan.v.d.plaat@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add the DS touch screen

The view fills the top screen. hud_nds.c has the game draw the touch
screen like the other ports: at the top the game's own status bar, drawn
as if the view were small, in the middle the map of the walls of the
sectors you have seen, turned so you look up, the solid ones at your
height brighter, with the level name, time, kills and secrets, and at
the bottom two rows of cells with the weapons' pickup pictures and ammo.
Only what changed is drawn again and copied to VRAM. Tapping a weapon
selects it, the inventory box picks the next item, the map zooms. Outside of a
level and in the menus the touch screen shows the controls.
---
